train.answer:
This excerpt gives a warning, not a complete repair procedure. It does not establish removal, installation or testing stages. Its stated precaution is [S1]:

• Remove the antenna in the following cases;

• When washing the vehicle with an automatic car washer;

• If antenna touches the parking garage ceiling;

• When attaching the body cover;

• Install the antenna to the original position before driving.

• Push the antenna downward when you do not listen to the radio.
